From 7fa2b426644b89634f9eebd3d017b4875d54a301 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christoph Berliner <32103696+Styx85@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:18:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rocblas: tune the gfx90c HHS_BH NN and NT selection tables on
 gfx90c

Same procedure as for the TN tables: re-measure every solution of
Cijk_Ailk_Bljk_HHS_BH (NN, 109 solutions) and Cijk_Ailk_Bjlk_HHS_BH
(NT, 88 solutions) on gfx90c for the vega10 sizes (<= 20 GFLOP,
<= 600 MB, >= 2 MFLOP) and an M/N/K grid (M, K in {384 ... 8192},
N in {16 ... 2048}).

Selected solution vs. old default: NN median 1.61x (1800 sizes),
NT median 1.28x (1720 sizes). PyTorch fp16 matmul on gfx90c, GFLOPS:
a @ b.T 2048^3 835 -> 1517, 1500x768x768 850 -> 1493; a @ b 512^3
714 -> 1296, 2048x768x3072 1295 -> 1663.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
